WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Add work. Keep it moving. Add a task, then close it when the work is done.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.167
Open Tasks. Choose Tasks in the desktop sidebar.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.683
Add a task. Give it a name, a due date and a priority.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:09.683
Review the task form. Save it to put the work on your list.

00:00:09.683 --> 00:00:11.883
One list. One record. Tasks stay in the workspace, not in a provider.
